|description2 = ''Burst Fire's'' projectile is treated as a {{tip|basic attack}}: it hits any enemy unit a typical basic attack can; deals {{tip|basic damage}}; can {{tip|critically strike}} for {{as|{{critical damage|{{ccd|Zeri|crit_base}}|100}}|critical damage}} damage; and applies {{tip|on-hit}} and {{tip|on-attack}} effects to the first enemy hit. ''Burst Fire's'' {{sti|cooldown}} and cast time are reduced with {{sti|{{as|attack speed}}}}, with the maximum of {{as|{{fd|1.5}}|attack speed}} attacks per second. 60% of {{as|attack speed}} in excess of the cap is converted into {{sti|{{as|'''bonus''' attack damage}}}}.
|description3 = '''''Zeri''' can cast Burst Fire while {{tip|silence|silenced}}.''
